      "content": "okay i guess i'll try to just relax then. i am starting to get a bit of a dull headache though, maybe from the lack of sleep? if my head starts hurting more or if the swelling feels tighter, is there anything i can take for the pain? like an advil or something? i just want to feel better so i can sleep.",
